{"id":"c5514506c707c9ae","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-description-numbering.md","title":"Effective Numbering of Finite Machine Descriptions","display":"df-tm-description-numbering — Effective Numbering of Finite Machine Descriptions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","aliases":["88-df-tm-description-numbering"],"display":"df-tm-description-numbering — Effective Numbering of Finite Machine Descriptions","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-transition]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-function]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-description-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-description-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-description-numbering — Effective Numbering of Finite Machine Descriptions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0272d8602e3436b1\" href=\"?note=0272d8602e3436b1\" title=\"88-df-tm-transition\">88-df-tm-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 及其八个坐标投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R\">\\(L,R\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0272d8602e3436b1\" href=\"?note=0272d8602e3436b1\" title=\"88-df-tm-transition\">88-df-tm-transition</a> 的两个方向符号，不是本文件的集合或规则参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 的固定单射有限元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fincode}\">\\(\\operatorname{fincode}\\)</span> 编码有限自然数集合的严格递增枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dircode}\">\\(\\operatorname{dircode}\\)</span> 编码方向；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tmcode}\">\\(\\operatorname{tmcode}\\)</span> 编码原八元组机器，未改变机器本身。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\)</span> 是输入字母表恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 的机器子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{88}\">\\(L_{88}\\)</span> 是下述固定不停机机器；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tmdecode}\">\\(\\operatorname{tmdecode}\\)</span> 对无效代码返回该机器。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为候选机器族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}\">\\(\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}\\)</span> 分别表达有效描述、完整覆盖、原始递归描述。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}\\)</span> 只要求覆盖停机行为，不要求逐字覆盖机器输出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\)</span> 与输入词编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>。所有函数输入位置的一元约定与上述数值函数文件一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a=(a_0,\\ldots,a_{m-1})\">\\(\\vec a=(a_0,\\ldots,a_{m-1})\\)</span> 采用从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始的坐标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;m\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;m\\}\\)</span>，包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 的空元组情形。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fincode}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;(&amp;\nA=\\{a_i:0\\leq i&lt;m\\}\\land c=\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\to a_i&lt;a_j))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{fincode},&amp;\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:|A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dircode}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\langle L,0\\rangle,\\langle R,1\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fincode}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;(&amp;\nA=\\{a_i:0\\leq i&lt;m\\}\\land c=\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec a)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(i&lt;j\\to a_i&lt;a_j))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{fincode},&amp;\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:|A|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dircode}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\langle L,0\\rangle,\\langle R,1\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{tabcode}(M)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fincode}\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(q,a,r,b,\\operatorname{dircode}(d)):\n&amp; q,r\\in Q_M\\land a,b\\in\\Gamma_M\\land d\\in\\{L,R\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\langle\\langle q,a\\rangle,\\langle r,b,d\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\delta_M\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(\n&amp;\\operatorname{fincode}(Q_M),\\operatorname{fincode}(\\Sigma_M),\n\\operatorname{fincode}(\\Gamma_M),B_M,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{tabcode}(M),q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\nq_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{tabcode}(M)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fincode}\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(q,a,r,b,\\operatorname{dircode}(d)):\n&amp; q,r\\in Q_M\\land a,b\\in\\Gamma_M\\land d\\in\\{L,R\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\langle\\langle q,a\\rangle,\\langle r,b,d\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\delta_M\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(\n&amp;\\operatorname{fincode}(Q_M),\\operatorname{fincode}(\\Sigma_M),\n\\operatorname{fincode}(\\Gamma_M),B_M,\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{tabcode}(M),q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\nq_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall M,N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\quad\n(\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(N)\\to M=N),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathrm{TM}:\\Sigma_M=\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n&amp;L_{88}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\langle\\{0,1,2\\},\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1,2\\},2,\n\\{\\langle\\langle0,a\\rangle,\\langle0,a,R\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\},0,1,2\\bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;L_{88}\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Halts}_{L_{88}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall M,N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\quad\n(\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(N)\\to M=N),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathrm{TM}:\\Sigma_M=\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n&amp;L_{88}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\langle\\{0,1,2\\},\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1,2\\},2,\n\\{\\langle\\langle0,a\\rangle,\\langle0,a,R\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\},0,1,2\\bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;L_{88}\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Halts}_{L_{88}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TMCode}(c)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nc\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=c,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tmdecode}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\langle c,M\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}:\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=c\\lor(\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c)\\land M=L_{88})\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{tmdecode},\\mathbb N,\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TMCode}(c)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nc\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=c,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tmdecode}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\langle c,M\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}:\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=c\\lor(\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c)\\land M=L_{88})\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{tmdecode},\\mathbb N,\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\chi_{\\mathrm{TMCode}}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{normtm}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}c,&amp;\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\\\\\operatorname{tmcode}(L_{88}),&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\chi_{\\mathrm{TMCode}}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\\\0,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{normtm}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}c,&amp;\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\\\\\operatorname{tmcode}(L_{88}),&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\n\\land\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_1(d)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nd(e)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(M_e)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;M_e=M,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(d)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nd(e)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(M_e)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\n\\land\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_1(d)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nd(e)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(M_e)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;M_e=M,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(d)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nd(e)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(M_e)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\chi_{\\mathrm{TMCode}})\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\operatorname{normtm})\n\\land\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}((\\operatorname{tmdecode}(e))_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\chi_{\\mathrm{TMCode}})\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\operatorname{normtm})\n\\land\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}((\\operatorname{tmdecode}(e))_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限集合用递增序列表示；转移表先将每行编码成自然数，再编码这些行所成的有限集合。这样既不依赖未指定的排序，也不会把有限集合对象直接交给只接受数值元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span>。八元组编码的单射性由各层编码的单射性逐层得到。</p>\n<p>解码和验证只需分解给定代码的有界素数幂，并在解出的有限集合、有限表中检查类型、互异性、转移表的全定义性与单值性。各分量的搜索界可取相应自然数代码；因此有效代码的特征函数及规范化数值函数都是原始递归的。这给出了谓词的具体见证，而不是仅假设存在某个未给出的“标准编号”。</p>\n<p>后续文件可以保留其已经固定的机器族，只需声明它满足相应编号谓词；这里没有把既有索引重新排列，也没有改变原始机器的输出。对每个固定元数，完整且可计算的描述编号可通过搜索相同描述码进行有效编译；原始递归描述还保证有限运行检查的原始递归性。</p>\n<p>完整覆盖机器与覆盖停机行为不同。后者允许先模拟原机器、停机后清理纸带并输出固定二进制词的规范化机器族，因此它可以同时具有统一的有限输出字母表。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-transition","status":"resolved","id":"0272d8602e3436b1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9041d99d4fa03d32","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 及其八个坐标投影见 [[88-df-turing-machine]]；$L,R$ 是 [[88-df-tm-transition]] 的两个方向符号，不是本文件的集合或规则参数。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-transition","status":"resolved","id":"0272d8602e3436b1","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 及其八个坐标投影见 [[88-df-turing-machine]]；$L,R$ 是 [[88-df-tm-transition]] 的两个方向符号，不是本文件的集合或规则参数。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定单射有限元组编码；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$、$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9041d99d4fa03d32","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定单射有限元组编码；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$、$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定单射有限元组编码；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$、$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定单射有限元组编码；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 见 [[88-df-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$、$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))$ 与输入词编码见 [[88-df-tm-halts]]、[[88-df-encoding]]。所有函数输入位置的一元约定与上述数值函数文件一致。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))$ 与输入词编码见 [[88-df-tm-halts]]、[[88-df-encoding]]。所有函数输入位置的一元约定与上述数值函数文件一致。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"L,R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fincode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dircode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tmcode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tmdecode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a=(a_0,\\ldots,a_{m-1})","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fincode}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,c\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;(&\nA=\\{a_i:0\\leq i<m\\}\\land c=\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec a)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\;(i<j\\to a_i<a_j))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{fincode},&\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:|A|<\\aleph_0\\},\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dircode}\\coloneqq{}&\\{\\langle L,0\\rangle,\\langle R,1\\rangle\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{tabcode}(M)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{fincode}\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(q,a,r,b,\\operatorname{dircode}(d)):\n& q,r\\in Q_M\\land a,b\\in\\Gamma_M\\land d\\in\\{L,R\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\langle\\langle q,a\\rangle,\\langle r,b,d\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\delta_M\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{enc}\\bigl(\n&\\operatorname{fincode}(Q_M),\\operatorname{fincode}(\\Sigma_M),\n\\operatorname{fincode}(\\Gamma_M),B_M,\\\\\n&\\operatorname{tabcode}(M),q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\nq_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall M,N\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\quad\n(\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(N)\\to M=N),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathrm{TM}:\\Sigma_M=\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\n&L_{88}\\coloneqq\\bigl\\langle\\{0,1,2\\},\\{0,1\\},\\{0,1,2\\},2,\n\\{\\langle\\langle0,a\\rangle,\\langle0,a,R\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\},0,1,2\\bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n&L_{88}\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\mathrm{Halts}_{L_{88}}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TMCode}(c)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nc\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=c,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tmdecode}\\coloneqq{}&\\{\\langle c,M\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}:\n\\operatorname{tmcode}(M)=c\\lor(\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c)\\land M=L_{88})\\},\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{tmdecode},\\mathbb N,\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\chi_{\\mathrm{TMCode}}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1,&\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\\\0,&\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{normtm}(c)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}c,&\\mathrm{TMCode}(c),\\\\\\operatorname{tmcode}(L_{88}),&\\neg\\mathrm{TMCode}(c).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\n\\land\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_1(d)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nd(e)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(M_e)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;M_e=M,\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(d)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nd(e)=\\operatorname{tmcode}(M_e)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal M:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_{\\mathrm{bin}}\\;\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Halts}_{M_e}(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}description\\text{-}numbering}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\chi_{\\mathrm{TMCode}})\n\\land\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(\\operatorname{normtm})\n\\land\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}((\\operatorname{tmdecode}(e))_{e\\in\\mathbb N})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false}],"bytes":7069,"backlinks":[{"id":"55266516c016ab89","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ 还满足 $\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)$，见 [[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]。仅仅逐一模拟一个任意的固定机器族，并不保证该族的停机问题不可判定。"},{"id":"353b45b92236cdbb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ 为已固定的机器族，满足 $\\mathrm{FullTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M)$；定义见 [[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]。输入字母表明确为 $\\{0,1\\}$。"},{"id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对每个 $k\\in\\mathbb N^+$，保留已固定的机器族 $\\mathcal M^{(k)}=(M_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$，并明确要求 $\\mathrm{PRTMNumbering}(\\mathcal M^{(k)})$；描述码、有效性、完整覆盖及原始递归条件见 [[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]。下式仍由同一族机器诱导 $\\varphi_e^{(k)}$。"},{"id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$ 为固定的有效二进制输入机器族，满足 $\\mathrm{EffTMFamily}(\\mathcal M)$，见 [[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]。这不自动要求覆盖全部具有任意输出字母表的机器。"},{"id":"94cc6e7e3caa17f9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on",